  "description": "It has already become the norm that carbon road bikes look like moving spaceships. We have decided against this and focus on chic and timeless design.\n\nNevertheless, the KRONPRINZ Carbon v2 does not need to hide from other carbon racing bikes. We have nevertheless equipped it with the latest bells and whistles.\n\nPOWER\n\nWhether steep descents or in unpredictable city traffic. Powerful disc brakes bring you safely and quickly to a halt in any situation.\n\nSLEEK DESIGN\n\nInternal cable routing provides not only a clean look but also better aerodynamic performance.\n\nCOMFORT & STIFFNESS\n\nCarbon has the advantage that it is extremely stiff in one direction and thus brings the power directly to the asphalt. On the other hand, however, dampens bumps and thus offers more comfort than other materials. Through a tire clearance of up to 32mm you also have another way to increase the comfort.",
